      "content": "it seems like you've already made up your mind about the intentions of people who support restorative justice. isn't it possible that many people advocate for it not because they want to \"save face\" for offenders, but because they see the current retributive system as failing to reduce recidivism or address the actual harm done to communities? why does it seem like the only motivation behind restorative justice is social engineering?",
